@startuml Authentication Flow
title B2B & B2C Customer Authentication

actor B2BCustomer as "B2B Customer"
actor B2CCustomer as "B2C Customer"
participant Portal as "Customer Portal"
participant AuthService as "AuthService"
participant Community as "Salesforce Community"
participant ExternalAuth as "External Auth Provider"
participant Database as "Salesforce DB"
participant Session as "Session Manager"

== B2B Customer Login ==
B2BCustomer -> Portal: Access portal URL
Portal -> Community: Redirect to Experience Cloud
Community -> B2BCustomer: Show login form

B2BCustomer -> Community: Enter credentials (email/password)
Community -> Database: Validate User__c + Contact
Database --> Community: User data + Account info

alt Valid credentials
    Community -> Session: Create session + JWT token
    Session --> Community: Session established
    Community -> Portal: Redirect with auth token
    Portal -> Session: Validate token
    Session --> Portal: User context + permissions
    Portal --> B2BCustomer: Dashboard + B2B features
else Invalid credentials
    Community --> B2BCustomer: Error message
end

== B2C Customer Login ==
B2CCustomer -> Portal: Click "Sign In"
Portal -> B2CCustomer: Show unified login form

alt Social Login (Google/Facebook)
    B2CCustomer -> ExternalAuth: Authenticate with provider
    ExternalAuth --> Portal: OAuth callback + user data
else Email/Password Login
    B2CCustomer -> Portal: Enter email + password
    Portal -> AuthService: authenticateUser(credentials)
    AuthService -> Database: SELECT FROM B2CUser__c
    Database --> AuthService: User record
end

AuthService -> Database: Validate password hash
Database --> AuthService: Validation result

alt Valid B2C credentials
    AuthService -> Session: Create session token
    Session --> AuthService: JWT token
    AuthService --> Portal: Auth success + user profile
    Portal --> B2CCustomer: Welcome + B2C features
else Invalid credentials
    AuthService --> Portal: Authentication failed
    Portal --> B2CCustomer: Error message
end

== Session Management ==
note over Session
    - JWT tokens for API calls
    - Session timeout handling
    - Cross-tab session sync
    - Logout invalidation
end note

== Permission Context ==
Portal -> Database: Load user permissions + account data
Database --> Portal: B2B/B2C specific features

alt B2B User
    Portal --> B2BCustomer: Show bulk pricing, quotes, account management
else B2C User
    Portal --> B2CCustomer: Show retail pricing, personal orders, wishlist
end
@enduml